  "notes": "{選択|せんたく}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ is used as a する-verb meaning \"to choose\" or \"to select.\"\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {選択|せんたく}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to select, to choose)\n- ⟦{選択|せんたく}{肢|し}→選択肢：14418_sentakushi⟧ (option, alternative)\n- {選択|せんたく}⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{余地|よち}→余地：07612_yochi⟧ (room for choice)\n- {選択|せんたく}⟦{科目|かもく}→科目：00163_kamoku⟧ (elective subject)\n- {選択|せんたく}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{迫|せま}られる→迫る：03928_semaru⟧ (to be forced to choose)\n\nWATCH OUT:\n{選択|せんたく} (selection) vs ⟦{洗濯|せんたく}→洗濯：13283_sentaku⟧ (laundry) - same reading, different kanji and meaning.",
